owicz1/status/2112469050273992734"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112455361156513792"]},"author_id":"733647469305864195","created_at":"2026-10-20T08:06:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112455374075035781"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/D8kS9LQgay","end":255,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2112455374075035781/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112455361156513792","start":232,"url":"https://t.co/D8kS9LQgay"}]},"id":"2112455374075035781","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":8393,"like_count":38,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":7},"text":"Want to start a thread on last week's TIC data not with China but with Japan.   The August data showed a big fall in bill holdings (consistent with Japan's intervention) but no real change in its holdings of long-term bonds ...\n\n1/ https://t.co/D8kS9LQgay","url":"https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2112455374075035781"},{"author_id":"917683048782503937","created_at":"2026-10-20T08:03:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112454572887191634"],"id":"2112454572887191634","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":264,"impression_count":58759,"like_count":921,"quote_count":29,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":211},"text":"FT: In Brazil, \"almost 2mn people, mostly men, now work full-time for transport or delivery apps — around 2 per cent of the workforce — with driver numbers climbing 37 per cent in three years, according to government research. The most common reason people work for the apps is","url":"https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2112454572887191634"},{"author_id":"733647469305864195","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:58:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112453302491476302"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/gusbaratta/sta…","end":239,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/gusbaratta/status/2112439362990289384","start":216,"url":"https://t.co/QELrW93cP8"}]},"id":"2112453302491476302","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":13340,"like_count":129,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":12},"text":"Sadly, winning at tax competition pays ... \n\nIreland runs a large surplus largely because a small subset of US companies pay more tax in Dublin than in DC.  \n\nNeeds a policy response beyond BEPS/ the two pillars ... https://t.co/QELrW93cP8","url":"https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2112453302491476302"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112422851894800384"]},"author_id":"733647469305864195","created_at":"2026-10-20T05:57:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112422864163086762"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tq9lxICEKA","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2112422864163086762/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112422851894800384","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/tq9lxICEKA"}]},"id":"2112422864163086762","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":18795,"like_count":133,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":39},"text":"There is now a clear understanding that China's growth continues to rely on net exports to an almost unprecedented extent for a large economy.  The YTD 1.2 pp contribution from net exports is close to the 1.5 pp of the last 2 years, but is almost certainly an underestimate\n\n1/ https://t.co/tq9lxICEKA","url":"https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2112422864163086762"},{"author_id":"497231011","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:43:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112389193636761683"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/caixin/status/…","end":45,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/caixin/status/2112151789114139003","start":22,"url":"https://t.co/iiX7xCmtOW"}]},"id":"2112389193636761683","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2160,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"\"accelerated to 1.1%\" https://t.co/iiX7xCmtOW","url":"https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2112389193636761683"},{"author_id":"917683048782503937","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:39:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112388091851776156"],"id"